  "label": "Cremation Ovens Historical Context",
  "description": "Cremation ovens, particularly in the context of mass death, are historically linked to the Holocaust and other genocides. Understanding this context is necessary to interpret the meme's use of the imagery as a metaphor for destruction, which is inherently tied to real-world atrocities.",
